Participating in society
This competency is about participating meaningfully in school, families, communities, and society, 
at local, national and global level, in person and online. As students participate in society, they 
deepen their understanding of human rights and responsibilities, diversity, equity, inclusion, social 
justice, and sustainability. They demonstrate their commitment to meaningful participation in 
school and society in a range of ways. They are aware of and engaged with societal issues, 
seeking to understand why these issues arise and to mitigate their impacts. They advocate for and 
try to bring about positive change.
